      },
      {
       "text": "One noticeable change is the addition of a new weapon reload time indicator in the game interface 🎯.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the NEXT UPDATE, you'll be able to upgrade turret weapons up to level 5 🔫",
